<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">霖楓學苑 · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小三 · 第 12 堂 · 學生版講義</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">同分母分數加法</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">[學生練習版 · 課堂工作紙] 單元四 · 和 ≤ 1 的同分母加法 · 65 分鐘</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>核心陷阱：</b>🪤 分母加分母！分子加分子同時分母也相加 — 這是致命錯誤！<br/>
<b>前置知識：</b>堂11（分數概念）<br/>
<b>本堂目標：</b>❶ 同分母分數加法 ❷ 用圖形理解加法 ❸ 和 ≤ 1 ❹ 分數應用<br/>
<b>對應教材：</b>《小學數學新思維》3上A冊 單元六
</div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>學生姓名：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>班級：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>日期：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>完成時長：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div></div>
<div>
<div class="lf-parent-summary">
<div class="lf-ps-title">家長30秒摘要</div>
    本堂重點：<span class="lf-ps-tag trap">陷阱破解</span><span class="lf-ps-tag goal">掌握關鍵概念</span><span class="lf-ps-tag sspa">呈分試關聯</span><span class="lf-ps-tag hk">香港課程</span><br/>
<strong>學完本堂，小朋友將能夠：</strong>① 識別本課陷阱 ② 正確解題 ③ 應用口訣<br/>
<strong>常見錯誤：</strong>請留意講義中的警告框<br/>
<strong>家中鞏固建議：</strong>完成課後3題練習，重點留意陷阱題
  </div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、熱身啟動題 （5 分鐘）（共 5 題）<span class="star">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 陷阱獵人·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">每題限時90秒！搵出隱藏嘅陷阱，答對+1分，連續答對分數加倍！留意題目中嘅「陷阱關鍵字」— 佢會話你知邊度最易出錯！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⭐ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = ？（想像：5 份中的 1 份 + 2 份 = ？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？（4 份中的 1 份 + 2 份）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>下面邊個啱？A. <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> B. <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span></td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>一個蛋糕切 8 等份。小明吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>，小華吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>。兩人共吃了幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = ？如果和 = <span class="f"><span class="n">8</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>，等於多少？（提示：<span class="f"><span class="n">8</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = 1 個整體！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、核心知識精講 （15 分鐘）</div>
<div class="lf-story"><div class="lf-story-title">🍕 Pizza店大冒險</div>一個Pizza切咗8份。小明食咗3份，小華食咗2份。佢哋一共食咗幾多個Pizza？等我哋用分數加法計吓！記住口訣：分母不變，分子相加！</div>一個Pizza切咗8份。小明食咗3份，小華食咗2份。佢哋一共食咗幾多個Pizza？等我哋用分數加法計吓！記住口訣：分母不變，分子相加！</div>Pizza分著食 —「一個Pizza切8份，食咗3份，即係食咗3/8個！」<div class="lf-notes lf-no-break"><div class="lf-notes-title">課堂筆記 / 草稿區</div><div class="lf-notes-lines"></div></div></div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：同分母加法 = 只加分子！<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 P3 最重要！</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>黃金法則：同分母分數相加 ——</strong><br>
  ① <strong>分母不變</strong>（因為每份大小相同！）<br>
  ② <strong>分子相加</strong>（只加攞咗幾多份）<br>
  ③ 例如：<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">1+2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span><br/>
  ④ <strong>記住：</strong>分母唔會加！分母只係話俾你知「每份有幾大」！
</br></br></br></div></div>
<div class="lf-why">
<div style="font-weight:900;color:#1A3C6D;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:6px;">WHY BOX：為甚麼異分母分數不能直接相加？</div>
<div style="font-size:12px;color:#374151;line-height:1.8;">
想像一個 pizza 分成 <b>2 份</b>（1/2），另一個分成 <b>3 份</b>（1/3）。<br/>
兩份的大小不同！一份是半個 pizza，一份是三分之一個 pizza。<br/>
<b>關鍵：</b>必須先把它們切成 <b>一樣大小的份數</b>（通分 — 找 LCM），才能比較或相加。<br/>
1/2 = 3/6，1/3 = 2/6 → 3/6 + 2/6 = 5/6 ✅<br/>
<em style="color:#6B7280;">數學本質：分數的分母代表「單位大小」，不同單位不能直接相加（就像 1cm + 1m ≠ 2，要先轉換單位）。</em>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 1：用圖形理解（Pizza法！）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q"><span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？</div>
<div class="frac-diag">
<svg height="90" viewbox="0 0 230 90" width="230" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="5" y="20"></rect><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="27" y="66">1/4</text><rect fill="#FFF" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="50" y="20"></rect><rect fill="#FFF" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="95" y="20"></rect><rect fill="#FFF" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="140" y="20"></rect><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="97" y="82">+</text></svg>
<svg height="90" viewbox="0 0 230 90" width="230" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="5" y="20"></rect><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="27" y="66">1/4</text><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="50" y="20"></rect><text fill="#6B7280" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="72" y="66">1/4</text><rect fill="#FFF" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="95" y="20"></rect><rect fill="#FFF" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="140" y="20"></rect><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="97" y="82">=</text></svg>
<svg height="90" viewbox="0 0 230 90" width="230" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="5" y="20"></rect><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="50" y="20"></rect><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="95" y="20"></rect><rect fill="#FFF" height="32" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="45" x="140" y="20"></rect><text fill="#16A34A" font-size="14" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="97" y="82">3/4</text></svg>
</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">分子：1 + 2 = 3 | 分母不變：4<br/><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span></div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 例題 2：陷阱引爆！</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q"><span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--lf-blue);">試試看！寫出你的計算步驟：</p></div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 致命陷阱（全港 P3 最高頻錯誤！）：同分母分數相加，<strong>分母不會相加</strong>！<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>，不是 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>！</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>判斷對錯：<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span>。如果錯，寫出正確答案。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>

<div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：和 = 1（等於一個整體）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
  ① 當分子 = 分母 → 等於 <strong>1 個整體</strong><br/>
  ② 例如：<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = 1、<span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = 1、<span class="f"><span class="n">8</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = 1<br/>
  ③ 和超過 1（如 <span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>）係 P4 先學，P3 最多計到 = 1
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 3</div><div class="lf-ex-q"><span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = ？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;"><span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">8</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = <strong>1</strong>（一整個！）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 4：三次加法</div><div class="lf-ex-q"><span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> = ？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">分子相加：1 + 2 + 3 = 6，分母不變：6<br/><span class="f"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> = <strong>1</strong></div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？（和 = 1？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span> = ？（和 = ？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">三、課堂分層同步練習 （20 分鐘）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 基礎層（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>=？ <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span>=？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=？ <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>=？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">7</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span>=？ <span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>=？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 進階層（共 3 題）</div>
