</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 學習目標回顧 — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有陷阱類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂口訣</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>易錯點</th><th>正確做法</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><strong>分母也相加</strong>：<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span></td><td>分母不變！只加分子：<span class="f"><span class="n">1+1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span></td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><strong>忘記分子只加不乘</strong></td><td>同分母加法 = 分子相加，不是相乘</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><strong>和 &gt; 1 時強行寫分數</strong></td><td>P3 階段和 ≤ 1；=1 時寫成 1</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><strong>不會用圖形驗證</strong></td><td>畫條/圓形，塗顏色驗證加法結果</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><strong>異分母當同分母加</strong></td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 唔可以直加！P4先學</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><strong>應用題忘記求「餘下」</strong></td><td>1 - 已用的分數 = 餘下的分數</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><strong>分子相加出錯</strong></td><td>小心：1+2+3 唔係 1x2x3！</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="mn">🧠 口訣一：「同分母相加好簡單，分母唔變企定定；分子相加寫上面，答案就係咁簡單。」</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 口訣二：「分母係份數唔會變，分子係攞幾多份至會加；分母加分母係大錯，分子加分子先至啱。」</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">①</div><div class="t">睇分母</div><div class="d">係咪相同？</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">②</div><div class="t">加分子</div><div class="d">分子相加</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">③</div><div class="t">分母不變</div><div class="d">照寫原來分母</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">④</div><div class="t">檢查</div><div class="d">和 ≤ 1？</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-tip" style="text-align:center;font-size:14px;">🌟 分母係個「單位名」，唔會因為加咗而變大！好似 2 個蘋果 + 3 個蘋果 = 5 個蘋果，單位「蘋果」唔會變！💪</div>
